vLLM supports distributed tensor-parallel and pipeline-parallel inference and serving.
The implementation includes [Megatron-LM's tensor parallel algorithm](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1909.08053.pdf).
The default distributed runtimes are [Ray](https://github.com/ray-project/ray) for multi-node inference and native Python `multiprocessing` for single-node inference.

